<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.rite.reads ~ receipts ~ rite-receipts

`lares rite receipts` runs `rite-receipts`: every half that verifies (`data.receipts`) and conferre's read of them (`data.conferre`). `--rite kukulu` reads every lent face's begun halves resting unlanded and the resting offer's hash (`offerBase`); `--branch` narrows them to its line.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ all · kukulu

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`all` params=`~ every verified half`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`kukulu` params=`rite/kukulu ~ the unlanded kūkulu halves and the offer base`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite ~ read one rite's unlanded halves`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name ~ narrow to one line`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ one face, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a read through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.rite.reads]] ~ a malformed face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

